1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,253
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,253 --> 00:00:03,840
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:04,933
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:08,013
=Episode 6=

5
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:14,800
When did this one get here?

6
00:00:16,519 --> 00:00:18,280
Dad knows you so well.

7
00:00:18,519 --> 00:00:19,519
In this dress,

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,359
you'll look understated yet elegant

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,000
and outshine everyone.

10
00:00:24,519 --> 00:00:26,199
Your dad got this for me?

11
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,039
I thought it was yours.

12
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:32,000
I wish I had your figure!

13
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:34,719
Dad really

14
00:00:34,799 --> 00:00:36,600
nailed your size.

15
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,119
It's gorgeous!

16
00:00:58,119 --> 00:01:01,119
(It fits surprisingly well.)

17
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,879
We still need to get your hair done.

18
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:06,840
We'll be late!

19
00:01:07,079 --> 00:01:07,599
Go, go, go!

20
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,159
(It's really nice.)

21
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:14,959
(Yeah.)

22
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:15,879
(I saw them.)

23
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,959
(They make such a perfect match.)

24
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:18,879
(Mrs. Wen,)

25
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:22,040
(I told you my sister and Zheng
were a perfect match.)

26
00:01:22,159 --> 00:01:23,959
Hua, I'll step out to take a call.

27
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:25,159
(Those two were meant to be.)

28
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:28,920
Hua!

29
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,000
Mrs. Wen.

30
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,359
Why didn't you tell me you were coming?

31
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,799
I could've met you at the door.

32
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:35,959
No need, Mrs. Wen.

33
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,519
Mom,

34
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:40,159
Mr. Zhao was looking for you.

35
00:01:40,319 --> 00:01:42,000
Maybe you should go attend to him first.

36
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:43,239
I'll take care of Hua.

37
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:43,719
Okay.

38
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:44,959
I'll let you two talk.

39
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,040
After you.

40
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,680
Excuse me.

41
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,080
Hua,

42
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:14,680
Zheng had this cake made just for me.

43
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,520
Here. Have a try.

44
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:22,599
Hua,

45
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:25,199
this is the engagement cake
for your brother and me.

46
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:28,039
Have a bite for good luck.

47
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,039
Don't tell me

48
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:31,479
you are still not over

49
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:32,840
your brother?

50
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,479
Exactly, Lin Hua.

51
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:40,000
My sister offered you cake
out of kindness.

52
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,800
If you won't have it,

53
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:44,360
you must still be hung up on Zheng

54
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,280
and refusing to move on.

55
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,800
(It's just a piece of cake.)

56
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:51,840
(Fine.)

57
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:54,159
(It's time I moved on for good.)

58
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,439
Here.

59
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:26,879
What's this?

60
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:35,319
(I made sure to add)

61
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,479
(lots of mango and mango sauce.)

62
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,039
I'll be there next time.

63
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:43,520
Okay.

64
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:44,759
Thank you, Mr. Gu. Thank you.

65
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,639
Hua, what's wrong?

66
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:49,919
Zheng, what are you doing?

67
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:50,800
An allergic reaction?

68
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:51,919
Did you eat mango?

69
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:53,400
Hua!

70
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,439
What's wrong?

71
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:55,639
Come on.

72
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:56,960
Let's get you to the hospital.

73
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,240
I'll go check.

74
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,319
Gu Zheng!

75
00:04:06,146 --> 00:04:10,853
(Jiang A66688)

76
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,439
Dad!

77
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:12,520
What happened?

78
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,039
Hua's having an allergic reaction.

79
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:15,000
I'm taking her to the hospital.

80
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:15,879
But...

81
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,279
Don't worry. I'm here.

82
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,560
Go home. Have Fen make chicken soup
and bring it to the hospital.

83
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,160
I...

84
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:21,240
Come with me.

85
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:27,700
(Jiang A66688)

86
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,199
Careful.

87
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:34,600
What are you doing here?

88
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,360
I was worried about you.

89
00:04:49,346 --> 00:04:51,666
(City Throne)

90
00:05:10,733 --> 00:05:13,290
♪You say you don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

91
00:05:14,026 --> 00:05:16,800
♪You're just fine on your own♪

92
00:05:17,306 --> 00:05:19,890
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

93
00:05:20,226 --> 00:05:22,810
♪And the pain you face at night♪

94
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:26,410
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

95
00:05:27,306 --> 00:05:29,860
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

96
00:05:30,106 --> 00:05:32,780
♪Some love needs no promises♪

97
00:05:33,053 --> 00:05:36,220
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

98
00:05:36,466 --> 00:05:38,800
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

99
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:42,010
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

100
00:05:42,706 --> 00:05:45,240
♪I'm right behind you♪

101
00:05:45,626 --> 00:05:48,610
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

102
00:05:48,973 --> 00:05:51,210
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

103
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:55,200
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

104
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:01,410
♪I'm right behind you♪

105
00:06:02,053 --> 00:06:03,410
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

106
00:06:03,493 --> 00:06:05,210
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

107
00:06:05,413 --> 00:06:07,520
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

108
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:09,226
♪I'm right behind you♪

109
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,680
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

110
00:06:11,946 --> 00:06:13,410
♪I won't claim you♪

111
00:06:13,533 --> 00:06:15,020
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

112
00:06:15,213 --> 00:06:17,680
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

113
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:21,026
♪Waiting for you♪
